  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ju clan village sits at the top of Ju Feng mountain, where strong winds blow all year and the clan long faces hurricane threat.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ju_feng_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ju clan village sits at the top of Ju Feng mountain and has hundreds of years of history.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hurricane-disaster-and-exodus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strong winds blow there all year, and the clan has long faced hurricane threats while holding onto a spiritual mountain with spirit springs.",
      "chapters": [
        304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hurricane-disaster-and-exodus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The text calls Ju clan a small size clan that still kept secrets for living through those disasters for hundreds of years without falling.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hurricane-disaster-and-exodus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A giant hurricane rarely seen in a hundred years destroys the village and the spirit spring, and many Ju clansmen die.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hurricane-disaster-and-exodus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The remnants leave for Shang Clan City, seeking refuge and hoping to rebuild later, then sell assets to live because city prices are high.",
      "chapters": [
        304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hurricane-disaster-and-exodus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Yang tells Fang Yuan that the remnants have submitted to Shang clan city and are auctioning large amounts of their collections, including a bitter strength Gu Fang Yuan has sought. Fang Yuan notes the clan had centuries of foundation and treats such disasters as common beside human conflicts.",
      "chapters": [
        304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_yang",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the auction, talk treats Ju clan as a centuries-standing house with deep foundations, and many buyers take pieces from that collection.",
      "chapters": [
        309
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ju clan specialized in wind type Gu on Ju Feng mountain; eating wind Gu is named as one specialty, and wind willows grow there because of the year-round wind.",
      "chapters": [
        307
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_eating_wind_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A thousand year wind willow can serve rank five refinement, and even after hundreds of years on Ju Feng mountain Ju clan had only eighteen such willows left.",
      "chapters": [
        307
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost arrow Gu is called a treasure of Ju clan village, compared with how Gu Yue clan collected moon type Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        306
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_frost_arrow_gu",
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The auction’s closing treasure is an unappraised recipe for heavenly essence treasure monarch lotus that Ju clan had kept; talk holds they never refined it because the recipe needs heavenly essence treasure lotus as the main ingredient.",
      "chapters": [
        308
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-of-clan-assets",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
